NOTICE ON USE

This software is intended for authorized security testing only — against
systems you own or have explicit written permission to test, typically through
a published bug-bounty program or a signed engagement.

The software enforces program scope, blocks destructive techniques, redacts
secrets and personal data, and requires human approval for side-effecting
tests. These controls are safeguards, not a substitute for authorization. The
operator is solely responsible for ensuring every test they run is permitted
by the target's owner and by applicable law.

Unauthorized access to computer systems is a criminal offence in most
jurisdictions.
